{"id":"944006f0-a120-4cc4-ac26-8cf955d581d2","title":"Use vscreen_launch to op","createdAt":1788427557103,"updatedAt":1788427592140,"messages":[{"id":"9e9385a0-4385-4949-8606-1ab36ffdf137","role":"user","content":"Use vscreen_launch to open com.android.settings, read it with vscreen_screen, tap the first list item, then vscreen_close. Report each step briefly. TASKX1","toolCalls":[],"error":false,"ts":1788427559233},{"id":"d74c8e51-eb72-452c-a697-2c20789619b6","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"tools_enable","argumentsJson":"{\"group\": \"extended\"}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"The user wants me to use vscreen_launch to open com.android.settings, read with vscreen_screen, tap the first list item, then vscreen_close. \n\nHowever, looking at my available tools, I don't have vscreen_launch, vscreen_screen, vscreen_tap, or vscreen_close in my tool list. These tools are in the \"extended\" tool group which is not loaded in this session. The system prompt says: \"本会话未加载的工具组：extended（无障碍操作/内置浏览器/虚拟屏/相机/定位/设备工具包/工作流等）；mcp（MCP 外部服务器工具）。这些组的工具不在你的工具清单里。需要时先调用 tools_enable（group=\"组名\"）启用\"\n\nSo I need to first enable the extended tool group to get access to vscreen_* tools.\n\nLet me call tools_enable with group=\"extended\" first.","ts":1788427572981},{"id":"5978b0ad-2df5-4e2e-aed9-64fd352141f2","role":"tool","content":"已启用 extended 工具组，相关工具已注入（本会话保持）。现在可以直接使用该组的工具。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"tools_enable","error":false,"ts":1788427572990},{"id":"7b680e6e-94d7-490e-8d51-4fade84939d0","role":"assistant","content":"我先启动虚拟屏打开系统设置。\n\n","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"vscreen_launch","argumentsJson":"{\"target\": \"com.android.settings\"}"}],"error":false,"ts":1788427581429},{"id":"13289c72-036d-439c-9634-d0eefa00c754","role":"tool","content":"目标 App 未出现在虚拟屏（窗口可能被重投递回主屏或 App 拒绝多屏）。请先关闭主屏上的该 App 后重试；仍失败则改用主屏 screen/tap 工具流程。","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_launch","error":true,"ts":1788427583987},{"id":"e57fd4fa-1472-4cc8-ba1e-190562c45794","role":"assistant","content":"启动没成功，先看看虚拟屏当前状态，再重试一次。\n\n","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_0_0","name":"vscreen_screen","argumentsJson":"{}"}],"error":false,"reasoning":"虚拟屏启动失败，提示 App 可能拒绝多屏或窗口被重投递回主屏。让我重试一次，或者先尝试 vscreen_screen 看看状态。\n\n按提示：先关闭主屏上的该 App 后重试。但我不能动主屏（有记忆说虚拟屏与主屏是两套体系，不过这里提示可以尝试）。先看看 vscreen_screen 能否读到东西。","ts":1788427591947},{"id":"a24950b5-bfcc-4674-8c60-d369c3b49a30","role":"tool","content":"共 30 个控件（用 vscreen_tap 的 index 参数直接点击）：\n[0] ScrollView \"«空»\" id=decor_content_parent (720,1600) <滚动>\n[1] RecyclerView \"«空»\" id=list (720,1817) <滚动>\n[2] RelativeLayout \"«空»\" (720,544) <点击>\n[3] SearchEditText \"搜索 / 搜索栏\" id=mc_search_edit (720,543) <点击,输入>\n[4] TextView \"\" (122,543)\n[5] FrameLayout \"语音搜索\" id=mc_voice_icon (1309,544) <点击>\n[6] TextView \"\" (1309,544)\n[7] TextView \"再见等于再也不见\" id=title (518,773)\n[8] TextView \"账号管理、云服务、支付设置和查找手机\" id=summary_vertical (718,851)\n[9] TextView \"我的手机\" id=title (727,1046)\n[10] TextView \"\" (1290,1046)\n[11] TextView \"运营商网络\" id=title (727,1371)\n[12] TextView \"\" (1290,1371)\n[13] TextView \"无线网络\" id=title (524,1588)\n[14] TextView \"CMCC-5Veg-5G\" id=summary (1033,1588)\n[15] TextView \"\" (1290,1588)\n[16] TextView \"个人热点\" id=title (524,1805)\n[17] TextView \"关闭\" id=summary (1033,1805)\n[18] TextView \"\" (1290,1805)\n[19] TextView \"蓝牙\" id=title (524,2022)\n[20] TextView \"开启\" id=summary (1033,2022)\n[21] TextView \"\" (1290,2022)\n[22] TextView \"更多连接方式\" id=title (727,2239)\n[23] TextView \"\" (1290,2239)\n[24] TextView \"Aicy 和 AI\" id=title (727,2564)\n[25] TextView \"\" (1290,2564)\n[26] TextView \"桌面、壁纸和个性化\" id=title (727,2889)\n[27] TextView \"\" (1290,2889)\n[28] TextView \"显示和亮度\" id=title (727,3106)\n[29] TextView \"\" (1290,3106)\n（截图已附上，红框标注上一步动作位置）","toolCalls":[],"toolCallId":"call_0_0","toolName":"vscreen_screen","error":false,"ts":1788427592138},{"id":"e917e344-306b-49a8-b6b5-5b1192e27c47","role":"user","cont